01:26:35,320 --> 01:26:42,320
And gas and oil seem to have a low effect in the cryptocurrency market.

888
01:26:42,320 --> 01:26:49,320
Regarding prediction, the dollar to Chinese yuan exchange rate emerged as the most important determinant.

889
01:26:49,320 --> 01:26:56,320
The model with lowest test mean square error was Random Forest with all the predictors data set.

890
01:26:56,320 --> 01:27:02,590
So this can be a model that can be used to predict the cryptocurrency market returns,

891
01:27:02,590 --> 01:27:06,720
suggesting also a nonlinear relationship between the predictors and the response.

892
01:27:07,740 --> 01:27:10,915
Boosting did not outperform random forest.

893
01:27:10,915 --> 01:27:15,850
This could be because cross-validation was used to determine the tuning parameters for boosting,

894
01:27:15,850 --> 01:27:20,860
and boosting may have overfitted the data, which random forest didn't do.

